      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>the way you say it... it almost makes it sound like a blessing. like, if that version of me is already gone, then what's the point of me still trying to hold on to this body and this life? it just feels so heavy and useless. like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. turn it around, does it even make sense to keep going when the \"me\" that mattered is totally erased?",
